{"page":141,"width":1858,"height":2777,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"4.5 임국적 스레딤","words":[{"text":"4.5","x":1274,"y":173,"width":58,"height":25},{"text":"임국적","x":1349,"y":174,"width":73,"height":27},{"text":"스레딤","x":1432,"y":173,"width":73,"height":28}]},{"text":"4.5.1 스레드를","words":[{"text":"4.5.1","x":311,"y":308,"width":111,"height":33},{"text":"스레드를","x":466,"y":306,"width":133,"height":37}]},{"text":"195","words":[{"text":"195","x":1585,"y":168,"width":59,"height":29}]},{"text":"4」 절에서 우리는 다중 스레드로 구성된 웹브라우저를 설명하였다. 그러한 웹 서버는","words":[{"text":"4」","x":310,"y":389,"width":43,"height":30},{"text":"절에서","x":363,"y":384,"width":92,"height":39},{"text":"우리는","x":475,"y":385,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"다중","x":592,"y":384,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"스레드로","x":673,"y":384,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"구성된","x":822,"y":384,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"웹브라우저를","x":944,"y":383,"width":206,"height":41},{"text":"설명하였다.","x":1168,"y":386,"width":179,"height":40},{"text":"그러한","x":1368,"y":387,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"웹","x":1491,"y":387,"width":30,"height":38},{"text":"서버는","x":1542,"y":386,"width":106,"height":39}]},{"text":"요청을 받을 때마다 그 요청을 위해 새로운 스레드를 만들어 준다. 새로운 스레드를 매","words":[{"text":"요청을","x":311,"y":448,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"받을","x":425,"y":448,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"때마다","x":506,"y":449,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"그","x":617,"y":454,"width":32,"height":26},{"text":"요청을","x":664,"y":448,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"위해","x":779,"y":448,"width":62,"height":40},{"text":"새로운","x":859,"y":448,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"스레드를","x":976,"y":448,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"만들어","x":1128,"y":450,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"준다.","x":1245,"y":451,"width":75,"height":38},{"text":"새로운","x":1339,"y":450,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"스레드를","x":1457,"y":450,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"매","x":1614,"y":450,"width":30,"height":38}]},{"text":"요청마다 만들어주는 것은, 그때마다 새로운 프로세스를 만들어주는 것보다는 확실히","words":