라는 점을 염두에 두면 더 그렇다. 두 번째","words":[{"text":"레드는","x":311,"y":702,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":423,"y":702,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"일만","x":469,"y":702,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"끝나면","x":546,"y":704,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"곧장","x":658,"y":705,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"용도","x":737,"y":705,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"폐기될","x":818,"y":706,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"것이라는","x":933,"y":707,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"점을","x":1080,"y":706,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"염두에","x":1161,"y":708,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"두면","x":1274,"y":708,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"더","x":1359,"y":708,"width":27,"height":38},{"text":"그렇다.","x":1404,"y":707,"width":110,"height":39},{"text":"두","x":1530,"y":709,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"번째","x":1580,"y":707,"width":64,"height":38}]},{"text":"이슈는 더 심각한 문제이다. 모든 요청마다 새 스레드를 만들어서 서비스해 준다면 시스","words":[{"text":"이슈는","x":310,"y":766,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"더","x":424,"y":765,"width":26,"height":38},{"text":"심각한","x":469,"y":766,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"문제이다.","x":580,"y":768,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"모든","x":737,"y":772,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"요청마다","x":816,"y":770,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"새","x":965,"y":772,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"스레드를","x":1011,"y":769,"width":135,"height":40},{"text":"만들어서","x":1160,"y":772,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"서비스해","x":1310,"y":771,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"준다면","x":1460,"y":771,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"시스","x":1577,"y":770,"width":69,"height":38}]},{"text":"템에서 동시에 실행할 수 있는 최대 스레드 수가 몇 개까지 가능할 수 있는 것인지 한계","words":[{"text":"템에서","x":310,"y":829,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"동시에","x":421,"y":830,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"실행할","x":536,"y":831,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":648,"y":833,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"있는","x":698,"y":833,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"최대","x":777,"y":833,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"스레드","x":856,"y":835,"width"