","x":309,"y":1021,"width":72,"height":38}]},{"text":"스레드 풀의 기본 아이디어는 프로세스를 시작할 때 아예 일정한 수의 스레드들을","words":[{"text":"스레드","x":369,"y":1085,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"풀의","x":485,"y":1086,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"기본","x":568,"y":1086,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"아이디어는","x":650,"y":1086,"width":168,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스를","x":833,"y":1086,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"시작할","x":1022,"y":1086,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"때","x":1141,"y":1087,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"아예","x":1191,"y":1087,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"일정한","x":1276,"y":1087,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"수의","x":1391,"y":1085,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"스레드들을","x":1476,"y":1084,"width":174,"height":38}]},{"text":"미리 풀로 만들어두는 것이다. 이 스레드들은 평소에는 하는 일 없이 일감을 기다리게","words":[{"text":"미리","x":309,"y":1148,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"풀로","x":389,"y":1150,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"만들어두는","x":472,"y":1150,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":657,"y":1150,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":784,"y":1150,"width":27,"height":38},{"text":"스레드들은","x":832,"y":1150,"width":172,"height":37},{"text":"평소에는","x":1021,"y":1150,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"하는","x":1173,"y":1150,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"일","x":1260,"y":1150,"width":30,"height":36},{"text":"없이","x":1310,"y":1149,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"일감을","x":1395,"y":1148,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"기다리게","x":1513,"y":1147,"width":134,"height":39}]},{"text":"된다. 서버는 스레드를 생성하지 않고 요청을 받으면 대신 스레드 풀에 제출하고 추가","words":[{"text":"된다.","x":308,"y":1212,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"서버는","x":400,"y":1213,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"스레드를","x":515,"y":1214,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"생성하지","x":665,"y":1214,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"않고","x":817,"y":1214,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"요청을","x":900,"y":1213,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"받으면","x":1020,"y":1213,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"대신","x":1141,"y":1213,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"스레드","x":1224